@startuml
title RADAR - System Context and Runtime Integrations
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

actor "RADAR User" as User
component "Dashboard\nNext.js" as Dashboard
component "Analyzer API\nASP.NET Core" as Analyzer
component "Collector\n.NET Worker" as Collector
database "PostgreSQL\nRADAR data" as Postgres
queue "Redis\nstreams/cache" as Redis
cloud "DLP Manager API" as Dlp
cloud "LDAP / Active Directory" as Ldap
cloud "IMAP Service Mailbox" as Imap
cloud "SMTP Relay" as Smtp
cloud "AI / Splunk /\nRemediation APIs" as External

User --> Dashboard : HTTPS
Dashboard --> Analyzer : REST API + JWT
Analyzer --> Postgres : EF Core / Npgsql
Analyzer --> Redis : stream processing / cache
Analyzer --> Ldap : authentication + user lookup
Analyzer --> Imap : inbox, replies, attachments
Analyzer --> Smtp : investigation and report mail
Analyzer --> Dlp : configuration, policies, tests
Analyzer --> External : AI, SIEM, remediation
Collector --> Dlp : incident collection
Collector --> Redis : publish events
Collector --> Analyzer : runtime configuration

note bottom of Analyzer
  Controllers, domain services,
  mail automation and schedulers
end note
@enduml
